emergencies, get to the mines, get 12-21 daggers and use them(then
leave the mines and do sokoban).  The daggers should be good for most
of the mid-game (using the +2 arrows in emergencies, but leaving the
+0 behind).  Enchant the daggers for the mid game.  Then you should be
able to do the quest and have a limitless supply of arrows, so enchant
and blessa couple of hundred arrows and you can mainly use them for
the late game.  For melee weapons I like to use Mojo or Magicbane (and
don't like chaotic rangers).  You shouldn't need anything else (I
usually enchance divination too for Identify and Magic Mapping).




